---
description: Test a rebuilt app with computer use before pushing
alwaysApply: true
---

After rebuilding excalidraw-mac, test that build with computer use before any git push.

- Launch the rebuilt binary directly with a throwaway `--user-data-dir`. Do not use `open --args` for that flag, and do not use the real `~/Library/Application Support/excalidraw-mac` store.
- Exercise the change in the running app and confirm it on a screenshot.
- Do not push until that check has been done.
